<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>FMSuperScout — Club Kit Colours</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<link rel="icon" href="logo.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #333333;
    --panel: #292929;
    --border: #4a4a4a;
    --header-divider: #5a5a5a;
    --text: #ffffff;
    --dim: #a0a0a0;
    --accent: #0078d7;
    --row-selected: #9ea4aa;
    --row-selected-border: #bdc2c7;
    --swatch-empty: #555555;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .hidden { display: none !important; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font: 14px/1.4 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;
    -webkit-user-select: none;
    user-select: none;
    overflow-y: scroll;
  }
  header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    background: #252525;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  header img { width: 22px; height: 22px; }
  header h1 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0; font-weight: 600; color: #e8e8e8; }
  header h1 span { color: #5aa9ff; }
  header a.back { margin-left: auto; color: #a8b2c0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; }
  header a.back:hover { color: #fff; text-decoration: underline; }

  #toolbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    background: #2b2b2b;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  #toolbar input[type=text] {
    background: #1f1f1f;
    border: 1px solid #555555;
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    min-width: 250px;
    font-size: 13px;
    outline: none;
  }
  #toolbar input[type=text]:focus {
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  button {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    border: none;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 13px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  button.secondary {
    background: #3a3a3a;
    border: 1px solid #555555;
    color: #f0f0f0;
  }
  #btn-export-json {
    background: #1f4f78;
    border: 1px solid #3174a8;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  #btn-export-json:hover {
    background: #28679b;
  }
  #btn-badge-location {
    background: #1c3d28;
    border: 1px solid #2d7348;
    color: #8ce9ad;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  #btn-badge-location:hover {
    background: #255336;
    border-color: #3bb36d;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  button:hover { filter: brightness(1.15); }
  #status { color: var(--dim); font-size: 12px; margin-left: auto; }

  #wrap {
    padding: 0 16px 30px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  #pager {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 14px 0 0;
  }
  #pager button:disabled { opacity: .4; cursor: default; }
  #page-info { color: var(--dim); font-size: 12px; min-width: 140px; text-align: center; }

  /* Table layout matching the screenshot */
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    background: var(--bg);
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  thead th {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: #dcdcdc;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
    text-align: left;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #666666;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--header-divider);
    -webkit-user-select: none;
    user-select: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  thead th:last-child {
    border-right: 1px solid var(--header-divider);
  }
  thead th.th-check {
    width: 44px;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 8px 6px;
  }
  thead th.th-id {
    width: 110px;
    min-width: 95px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  thead th.th-id:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  thead th.th-name {
    min-width: 230px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  thead th.th-name:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  thead th.th-division {
    min-width: 170px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  thead th.th-division:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  thead th.th-country {
    min-width: 120px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  thead th.th-country:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  thead th.sort-active {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  thead th.sort-active.sort-asc::after {
    content: " ▲";
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  thead th.sort-active.sort-desc::after {
    content: " ▼";
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  thead th.th-colours {
    width: 130px;
    min-width: 130px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  thead th.th-colours:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  thead th.th-style {
    width: 125px;
    min-width: 115px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  thead th.th-style:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  thead th.th-sponsor, thead th.th-template {
    width: 85px;
    min-width: 75px;
    text-align: center;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  thead th.th-sponsor:hover, thead th.th-template:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  thead th.th-shortname {
    width: 100px;
    min-width: 85px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  thead th.th-shortname:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  thead th.th-badge {
    min-width: 160px;
    max-width: 240px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  thead th.th-badge:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .table-input {
    background: #1f1f1f;
    border: 1px solid #555555;
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 3px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 12px;
    outline: none;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .table-input:focus {
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  tbody tr.row-selected .table-input {
    background: #333333;
    border-color: #777777;
  }
  .td-sponsor-input, .td-template-input {
    width: 70px;
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #9cdcfe;
  }
  .td-shortname-input {
    width: 85px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .badge-location-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: #8ce9ad;
    background: rgba(46, 109, 73, 0.22);
    border: 1px solid rgba(46, 109, 73, 0.45);
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    max-width: 220px;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .badge-location-tag:hover {
    background: rgba(46, 109, 73, 0.45);
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .badge-location-fallback {
    color: #ffd591;
    background: rgba(212, 107, 8, 0.18);
    border-color: rgba(212, 107, 8, 0.38);
  }
  .kit-style-select {
    background: #1f1f1f;
    border: 1px solid #555555;
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 3px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    outline: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    width: 105px;
  }
  .kit-style-select:focus {
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  tbody tr.row-selected .kit-style-select {
    background: #333333;
    border-color: #777777;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .badge-gender {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    margin-left: 6px;
    vertical-align: middle;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }
  .badge-women {
    background: rgba(235, 77, 150, 0.22);
    color: #ff85c0;
    border: 1px solid rgba(235, 77, 150, 0.45);
  }
  .badge-men {
    background: rgba(58, 140, 255, 0.15);
    color: #79b8ff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(58, 140, 255, 0.3);
  }
  .td-division-sub {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #8f9ca8;
    margin-top: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    max-width: 260px;
  }
  .toolbar-checkbox-label {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: #dedede;
    cursor: pointer;
    -webkit-user-select: none;
    user-select: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .toolbar-checkbox-label input {
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  /* Filter & Grouping controls */
  .group-control, .filter-control {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .toolbar-label {
    color: var(--dim);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  #sel-group, #sel-country, #sel-division {
    background: #1f1f1f;
    border: 1px solid #555555;
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 13px;
    outline: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    max-width: 220px;
  }
  #sel-group:focus, #sel-country:focus, #sel-division:focus {
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  tbody tr.tr-group-header {
    background: #252c35 !important;
    border-top: 2px solid #3d4a59;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #3d4a59;
    height: 38px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  tbody tr.tr-group-header:hover {
    background: #2c3541 !important;
  }
  tbody tr.tr-group-header td {
    padding: 6px 12px;
  }
  .group-header-content {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #e8e8e8;
  }
  .group-chevron {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 14px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #5aa9ff;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease;
  }
  .group-chevron.collapsed {
    transform: rotate(-90deg);
  }
  .group-title {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .group-badge {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #a0a0a0;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 10px;
  }
  .group-check-box {
    margin-right: 2px;
  }

  tbody td.td-division {
    color: #b8b8b8;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  tbody td.td-country {
    color: #dedede;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  tbody tr {
    cursor: pointer;
    background: var(--bg);
    border-top: 1px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    height: 33px;
  }
  tbody tr:hover {
    background: #3a3a3a;
  }
  tbody tr.row-selected {
    background: var(--row-selected) !important;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--row-selected-border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--row-selected-border);
  }
  tbody tr.row-selected td.td-name {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  tbody td {
    padding: 4px 12px;
    vertical-align: middle;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  tbody td.td-check {
    width: 44px;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4px 6px;
  }
  tbody td.td-id {
    color: #c0c0c0;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  tbody td.td-id:hover {
    color: #5aa9ff;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  tbody tr.row-selected td.td-id {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  tbody td.td-name {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  /* Custom Checkbox */
  .check-box {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    border: 1px solid #777777;
    background: transparent;
    transition: background-color 0.1s, border-color 0.1s;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .check-box.checked {
    background: var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .check-box svg {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    fill: none;
    stroke: #ffffff;
    stroke-width: 2.5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    display: none;
  }
  .check-box.checked svg {
    display: block;
  }
  .check-box.indeterminate {
    background: var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .check-box.indeterminate svg {
    display: none;
  }
  .check-box.indeterminate::after {
    content: "";
    width: 8px;
    height: 2px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 1px;
  }

  /* 3 Rectangular Swatches per kit cell */
  .swatches-container, .swatch-group {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .swatch {
    width: 22px;
    height: 13px;
    border-radius: 1px;
    display: inline-block;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    transition: transform 0.08s, filter 0.08s;
  }
  .swatch:hover {
    transform: scale(1.1);
    filter: brightness(1.2);
  }
  .swatch.filled {
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
  }
  .swatch.empty {
    background: transparent !important;
    border: 1px solid var(--swatch-empty);
  }

  #empty {
    padding: 60px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--dim);
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  #search-prompt {
    padding: 60px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--dim);
  }
  .search-prompt-icon {
    font-size: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
  .search-prompt-title {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #e0e0e0;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .search-prompt-desc {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #999999;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  #btn-show-all {
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  .instructions-hint {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: #888888;
    margin-left: 6px;
  }

  /* Export Paths Modal */
  .modal-backdrop {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100vw;
    height: 100vh;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 9999;
  }
  .modal-dialog {
    background: #252525;
    border: 1px solid #4a4a4a;
    border-radius: 8px;
    width: 560px;
    max-width: 92vw;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .modal-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    background: #1e1e1e;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #383838;
  }
  .modal-title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #e8e8e8;
  }
  .btn-close {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    color: #888;
    font-size: 22px;
    cursor: pointer;
    line-height: 1;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .btn-close:hover {
    color: #fff;
    background: #333333;
  }
  .modal-body {
    padding: 20px 18px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .form-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .form-group label {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #ddd;
  }
  .input-with-button {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .input-with-button input[type=text] {
    flex: 1;
    background: #181818;
    border: 1px solid #484848;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 7px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: 'Consolas', 'Segoe UI Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }
  .input-with-button input[type=text]:focus {
    border-color: #0078d7;
    outline: none;
  }
  .form-desc {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: #888;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .form-desc code {
    background: #181818;
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #5aa9ff;
    font-family: 'Consolas', monospace;
  }
  .modal-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    background: #1e1e1e;
    border-top: 1px solid #383838;
  }
  .badge-folder-stats {
    color: #5aa9ff;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .form-group-checkbox-label {
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <img src="logo.svg" alt="">
  <h1>FM<span>Super</span>Scout — Club Kit Colours</h1>
  <a class="back" href="index.html?v=1.5.0">&larr; Back to app</a>
</header>
<div id="toolbar">
  <input type="text" id="search" placeholder="Search club name, ID, division, country…" autofocus>
  <div class="filter-control">
    <label for="sel-gender" class="toolbar-label">Teams:</label>
    <select id="sel-gender" title="Filter by Men or Women teams" aria-label="Filter by gender">
      <option value="all">All Teams</option>
      <option value="men">Men Only</option>
      <option value="women">Women Only</option>
    </select>
  </div>
  <div class="filter-control">
    <label for="sel-country" class="toolbar-label">Country:</label>
    <select id="sel-country" title="Filter by country" aria-label="Filter by country">
      <option value="">All Countries</option>
    </select>
  </div>
  <div class="filter-control">
    <label for="sel-division" class="toolbar-label">Division:</label>
    <select id="sel-division" title="Filter by division in country" aria-label="Filter by division">
      <option value="">All Divisions</option>
    </select>
  </div>
  <div class="group-control">
    <label for="sel-group" class="toolbar-label">Group by:</label>
    <select id="sel-group" title="Group by column" aria-label="Group by column">
      <option value="none">None (Flat list)</option>
      <option value="division">Division</option>
      <option value="country">Country</option>
    </select>
  </div>
  <button id="btn-toggle-all-groups" class="secondary hidden">Collapse All</button>
  <div class="filter-control">
    <label for="sel-bulk-style" class="toolbar-label">Kit Style:</label>
    <select id="sel-bulk-style" title="Kit style for bulk apply" aria-label="Kit style">
      <option value="Plain" selected>Plain</option>
      <option value="Striped">Striped</option>
      <option value="Hooped">Hooped</option>
      <option value="Bicolour">Bicolour</option>
      <option value="Sleeved">Sleeved</option>
    </select>
    <button id="btn-apply-style" class="secondary" title="Apply chosen style to selected clubs">Apply to Selected</button>
  </div>
  <button id="btn-export-as" title="Choose file name and save location (Save CSV As…)">Save CSV As…</button>
  <button id="btn-badge-location" title="Enter or choose Club Badges Folder">🛡️ Badge Location</button>
  <button id="btn-paths-config" class="secondary" title="Configure CSV export location & Logo folder">⚙️ Settings</button>
  <label class="toolbar-checkbox-label" title="Differentiate women's teams by appending 'Women' (e.g. 'Arsenal Women') so Kitbasher doesn't collide with men's teams that are already imported">
    <input type="checkbox" id="chk-suffix-women" checked>
    <span>Suffix Women's teams</span>
  </label>
  <button id="btn-export-json" title="Export teams in Kitbasher JSON format">Export JSON</button>
  <button id="btn-select-all" class="secondary">Select All</button>
  <button id="btn-deselect-all" class="secondary">Deselect All</button>
  <span class="instructions-hint">(Left-click swatch to change, right-click to clear)</span>
  <span id="status"></span>
</div>
<div id="wrap">
  <div id="empty" class="hidden">No clubs database found. Open the main app and press F9 in-game to create a dump first.</div>
  <div id="search-prompt" class="hidden">
    <div class="search-prompt-icon">🔍</div>
    <div class="search-prompt-title">Search for any club in the database</div>
    <div class="search-prompt-desc">Type in the search box above to search by team name, unique ID, division, or country.<br><span id="db-count-label"></span></div>
    <button id="btn-show-all" class="secondary">Browse all clubs</button>
  </div>
  <table id="tbl" class="hidden">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th class="th-check"><div id="master-check" class="check-box" title="Toggle Select All"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><polyline points="2.5 8.5 6 12 13.5 4.5"></polyline></svg></div></th>
        <th class="th-name" id="th-team-name" data-key="club" title="Click to sort by Team Name">Team Name</th>
        <th class="th-id" id="th-unique-id" data-key="clubId" title="Click to sort by Unique ID">Unique ID</th>
        <th class="th-sponsor" id="th-sponsor" data-key="sponsor" title="Sponsor Grouping (Default: ALL)">Sponsor</th>
        <th class="th-template" id="th-template" data-key="template" title="Template Grouping (Default: ALL)">Template</th>
        <th class="th-shortname" id="th-shortname" data-key="shortName" title="Team Short Name">Short Name</th>
        <th class="th-badge" id="th-badge" data-key="badge" title="File Location of Badge">Badge Location</th>
        <th class="th-colours" id="th-home-colours" data-key="home" title="Click to sort by Home Colours">Home Colours</th>
        <th class="th-colours" id="th-away-colours" data-key="away" title="Click to sort by Away Colours">Away Colours</th>
        <th class="th-colours" id="th-third-colours" data-key="third" title="Click to sort by Third Colours">Third Colours</th>
        <th class="th-style" id="th-home-style" data-key="style" title="Click to sort by Home Style">Home Style</th>
        <th class="th-style" id="th-away-style" data-key="style-away" title="Click to sort by Away Style">Away Style</th>
        <th class="th-style" id="th-third-style" data-key="style-third" title="Click to sort by Third Style">Third Style</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody id="tbody"></tbody>
  </table>
  <div id="pager" class="hidden">
    <button id="btn-prev" class="secondary">Previous</button>
    <span id="page-info"></span>
    <button id="btn-next" class="secondary">Next</button>
  </div>
</div>
<!-- Badge Location Dedicated Modal -->
<div id="badge-modal" class="modal-backdrop hidden">
  <div class="modal-dialog">
    <div class="modal-header">
      <div class="modal-title">🛡️ Club Badges / Logos Folder</div>
      <button id="btn-close-badge-modal" class="btn-close" type="button" title="Close">&times;</button>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-body">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="input-quick-badge-dir">Enter the folder path where your club badges / logos are located:</label>
        <div class="input-with-button">
          <input type="text" id="input-quick-badge-dir" spellcheck="false" placeholder="C:\Users\aceik\AppData\Roaming\GeneratedKits\Badges">
          <button id="btn-browse-quick-badge-dir" type="button" class="secondary">Browse…</button>
        </div>
        <div class="form-desc">
          Kitbasher requires badge files on disk to import teams. FMSuperScout automatically searches <b>all subfolders recursively</b> to match each club by ID (e.g. <code>600.png</code>), club name (e.g. <code>Arsenal Logo.png</code>), or fallback placeholder so Kitbasher never fails badge import.
        </div>
        <div id="badge-folder-stats" class="form-desc badge-folder-stats"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-footer">
      <button id="btn-default-badge-dir" type="button" class="secondary">Use Default</button>
      <button id="btn-save-quick-badge-dir" type="button">Save Location</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<!-- Paths Configuration Modal -->
<div id="paths-modal" class="modal-backdrop hidden">
  <div class="modal-dialog">
    <div class="modal-header">
      <div class="modal-title">📁 Kitbasher Export Settings</div>
      <button id="btn-close-paths-modal" class="btn-close" type="button" title="Close">&times;</button>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-body">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="input-csv-name">Default CSV File Name:</label>
        <div class="input-with-button">
          <input type="text" id="input-csv-name" spellcheck="false" placeholder="teams.csv">
        </div>
        <div class="form-desc">File name for exported CSV (e.g. <code>teams.csv</code> or <code>premier_league.csv</code>).</div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="input-csv-dir">Default CSV Save Location:</label>
        <div class="input-with-button">
          <input type="text" id="input-csv-dir" spellcheck="false" placeholder="D:\KitbasherLegacy v0.8\TeamList">
          <button id="btn-browse-csv-dir" type="button" class="secondary">Browse…</button>
        </div>
        <div class="form-desc">Directory where <code>teams.csv</code> is exported directly for Kitbasher.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="input-logo-dir">Club Logos / Badges Location:</label>
        <div class="input-with-button">
          <input type="text" id="input-logo-dir" spellcheck="false" placeholder="C:\Users\aceik\AppData\Roaming\GeneratedKits\Badges">
          <button id="btn-browse-logo-dir" type="button" class="secondary">Browse…</button>
        </div>
        <div class="form-desc">Directory containing club badge files. Searches all subfolders recursively. Files are matched automatically by club ID, club name, or fallback placeholder so Kitbasher never fails badge import.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="toolbar-checkbox-label form-group-checkbox-label">
          <input type="checkbox" id="chk-always-prompt-save" checked>
          <span>Always prompt with "Save As…" dialog when clicking Export CSV</span>
        </label>
        <div class="form-desc">When checked, clicking Export CSV opens the native Windows Save dialog to choose file name and folder every time.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-footer">
      <button id="btn-reset-paths" type="button" class="secondary">Reset Defaults</button>
      <button id="btn-save-paths" type="button">Save Settings</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<input type="color" id="hidden-picker" aria-label="Kleurkiezer / Color picker" title="Kleurkiezer">
<script src="clubs.js?v=6"></script>
</body>
</html>
